---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set, selected by KASODI for its warm cream finish, simple Scandinavian lines and practical four-piece design."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set-cream.png"
            alt="Ava Nord cream ceramic bathroom accessories set styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM
          </p>

          <h1>
            Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Ava Nord
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A calm four-piece ceramic bathroom set designed to bring warmth
            and order to the everyday countertop. Finished in soft cream with
            a matte glaze and a contrasting black pump, it combines simple
            Scandinavian lines with practical bathroom storage.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Ceramic</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>4 pieces</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Warm cream</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Matte glazed ceramic</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Scandinavian · Minimal</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Includes</span>
              <strong>Dispenser · Tumbler · Jar · Soap dish</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4gjHGzq"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            The appeal of this set is in its restraint. The warm cream ceramic
            feels softer than stark white bathroom accessories, while the matte
            finish gives each piece a calm, tactile quality.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like the contrast of the black dispenser pump against
            the neutral ceramic. It gives the set a contemporary edge without
            disturbing the quiet palette. With four coordinated pieces, it is
            also an easy way to make an everyday bathroom counter feel more
            considered without introducing too many decorative elements.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep it looking beautiful</h2>

        <p>
          For everyday care, wipe the ceramic surfaces with a soft damp cloth
          or sponge. For a deeper clean, use mild soap and water. Avoid abrasive
          cleaners or rough scouring pads that may damage the matte glazed
          surface. Wipe the dispenser pump regularly and dry excess water around
          the base to keep the fittings and countertop looking clean.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Natural Woven Storage</h3>
            <p>
              Add a small woven or rattan basket beside the set to introduce
              natural texture and soften the clean ceramic shapes.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Soft Cotton Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal or pale beige cotton towels continue the warm
              neutral palette and give the bathroom a relaxed, layered feel.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Warm Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Light oak, bamboo or another warm natural wood balances the black
              pump and brings an organic element to the countertop.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-botanical-duvet-cover-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-duvet-cover-set.png"
                alt="Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME TEXTILES</span>
              <h3>Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set</h3>
              <p>Fashionbedding</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box.png"
                alt="Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box</h3>
              <p>Tila Home</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame.png"
                alt="Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame</h3>
              <p>LEVI DECOR</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          AVA NORD · CERAMIC BATHROOM SET
        </p>

        <h2>
          Quiet details for a calmer bathroom.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4gjHGzq"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>